    "name": "Morphlet v1.2.3",
    "body": "# Morphlet v1.2.3\n\n## Studio stability on macOS\n\n- Prevent a native appearance notification from recursively rebuilding the Studio glass regions.\n- Skip native material updates when the theme and layout have not changed.\n- Keep file selections and previews stable when updating the glass surface; material-only updates no longer resend the complete Studio state.\n- Avoid assigning an unchanged native window appearance.\n- Add regression tests for repeated appearance notifications, theme switching and sidebar changes.\n\nIncludes the v1.2.2 macOS signature correction and strict app/DMG verification. Mac packages remain ad-hoc signed and unnotarized; Windows packages remain unsigned.\n",
