    "tag_name": "v0.9.0",
    "name": "Morphlet v0.9.0",
    "body": "# Morphlet v0.9.0\n\n- PDF editing now lives inside Studio, sharing the header and file sidebar instead of opening a modal workspace.\n- Scroll continuously through PDF pages; the page list also scrolls. The page nearest the center becomes editable when scrolling settles.\n- Nearby page previews load on demand with at most two preview requests in flight. Offscreen previews are released, and draft additions remain visible on nearby pages.\n- Monochrome SVG icons accompany editing, annotation, image and page tools.\n- The Studio header uses the Morphlet wordmark without the m badge.\n- Light mode has a translucent white header backing and darker labels for contrast over busy backgrounds.\n\nValidation: 40 automated engine tests passed. Native desktop checks cover continuous scrolling to another page, text editing, both themes, save and return to conversion, plus image replacement and reopening the editor.\n",
