    "tag_name": "v0.8.0",
    "name": "Morphlet v0.8.0",
    "body": "# Morphlet v0.8.0\n\n## Original PDF images\n\nClick a supported embedded image in Studio\u2019s PDF editor, then choose Remove image or Replace image. Replacements preserve proportions and fit inside the original bounds. Undo restores removals; Restore original reverts replacements.\n\nOnly the selected placement changes, so other uses of a shared image remain intact. Image and original-text edits can be saved together. Originals are never overwritten.\n\nThis release supports page-level, axis-aligned raster image XObjects. Inline images, masks, clipped images, arbitrary rotations and images nested in Form artwork remain unsupported. Removing content is not secure redaction.\n\n## Documentation\n\nThe README now has a quick start, navigation links, grouped workflows, detailed text/image editing instructions, current platform behavior, and clearer conversion and editing limits.\n\n## Validation\n\n40 automated tests passed. Saved-file tests verify replacement pixels, original removal, shared placements, combined text edits and invalid selections. Native desktop checks passed for image selection, removal, undo, replacement and saving without duplicate images. README local links and anchors were checked.\n",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/the-mayankjha/morphlet/releases/tag/v0.8.0",
